]',NULL,'SF-2443-FSFR',0,20,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 14:49:27','2025-05-01 12:44:16',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-60.jpg','digital',NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL),(63,'11 11 Aqua','<p>A fresh and clean fragrance inspired by the power of the sea and the calm of nature. Bright citrus blends with floral notes and sage, resting on a base of cedarwood and musk for a crisp, invigorating finish.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Citrus Aquatic<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Clean<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Lemon, Bergamot, Jasmine, Sage, Cedarwood, Musk<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-59.jpg\",\"mid-00000-57.jpg\",\"box-00000-56.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-SYRB',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 14:51:50','2025-05-01 12:43:50',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-59.jpg','digital',NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL),(64,'11 11 Althair','<p>A luxurious and warm fragrance wrapped in refined sweetness. It opens with sparkling bergamot and spicy cinnamon, leads into a heart of creamy vanilla and musk, and finishes with smooth amber and guaiac wood for a sophisticated, lasting impression.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Vanilla<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Sweet<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Bergamot, Cinnamon, Vanilla, Musk, Amber, Guaiac Wood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml </p>','','published','[\"side-00000-57.jpg\",\"mid-00000-55.jpg\",\"box-00000-54.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-PO5G',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'2025-04-21 14:56:12','2025-05-01 12:43:34',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','mid-00000-5d4110ed-8b24-455a-9dc9-720d8340fe3d.png','digital',NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL),(65,'11 11 Bleu','<p>A fresh and sophisticated fragrance that blends vibrant citrus, aromatic herbs, and warm woody notes. This timeless scent embodies confidence and elegance, perfect for any occasion.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Aromatic<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh and Elegant<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Citrus, Aromatic Herbs, Woody Notes<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-69.jpg\",\"mid-00000-67.jpg\",\"box-00000-66.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-HFTD',0,50,0,0,'on_backorder',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-04-21 14:57:42','2025-05-01 12:43:18',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-61.jpg','digital',NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL),(66,'11 11 Eros','<p>A bold and vibrant fragrance that celebrates strength and sensuality. Fresh notes of mint and green apple blend with warm tonka bean and vanilla, resting on a base of cedarwood and oakmoss for a magnetic, masculine allure.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fresh Oriental<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Aromatic &amp; Sweet<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Mint, Green Apple, Tonka Bean, Vanilla, Cedarwood, Oakmoss<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-68.jpg\",\"mid-00000-66.jpg\",\"box-00000-65.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-CMJY',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 15:05:06','2025-05-01 12:43:01',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-68.jpg','digital',NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL),(67,'11 11 Gentlemen','<p>A bold and sophisticated fragrance that opens with vibrant black pepper, lavender, and bergamot. At the heart, orris, clove, and cinnamon add depth and warmth. The base settles into a smooth blend of black vanilla husk, tonka bean, benzoin, patchouli, and tolu balsam for a powerful masculine finish.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Aromatic<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Spicy &amp; Deep<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Black Pepper, Lavender, Bergamot, Orris, Clove, Cinnamon, Black Vanilla Husk, Tonka Bean, Benzoin, Patchouli, Tolu Balsam<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p><h2> </h2>','','published','[\"side-00000-62.jpg\",\"mid-00000-60.jpg\",\"box-00000-59.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-URXR',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 15:07:10','2025-05-01 12:42:42',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-62.jpg','digital',NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL),(68,'11 11 Guilty','<p>A captivating and modern scent that blends freshness with sensual depth. It opens with invigorating lemon and lavender, followed by a heart of orange blossom. The base combines warm cedarwood and patchouli, creating a confident and charismatic masculine signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Aromatic Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Warm<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Lemon, Lavender, Orange Blossom, Cedarwood, Patchouli<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-63.jpg\",\"mid-00000-61.jpg\",\"box-00000-60.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-OJ1I',0,20,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 15:19:53','2025-05-01 12:42:03',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-63.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(69,'11 11 Ispahan','<p><br>A rich and elegant oriental fragrance that blends smoky oud with luxurious florals. It opens with deep rose, softened by labdanum and patchouli, then settles into warm agarwood and sandalwood for a majestic, lingering trail.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Oud &amp; Floral<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Rose, Labdanum, Patchouli, Oud, Sandalwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-64.jpg\",\"mid-00000-62.jpg\",\"box-00000-61.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-CU8O',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-04-21 15:26:49','2025-05-01 12:32:13',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-64.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(70,'11 11 Lord','<p>A noble and refined fragrance that exudes sophistication and quiet power. It opens with a warm brandy accord, enriched by shaving soap and tonka bean, and finishes with a velvety blend of amber and woody notes for a distinguished, classic feel.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Elegant<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Brandy, Shaving Soap, Tonka Bean, Amber, Wood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-65.jpg\",\"mid-00000-63.jpg\",\"box-00000-62.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-V3QE',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 15:29:31','2025-05-01 12:31:28',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-65.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(71,'11 11 Million','<p>A bold and irresistible fragrance that radiates energy and charm. It opens with fresh grapefruit and spicy cinnamon, followed by a heart of rose and leather, and finishes with warm amber, patchouli, and woody notes for a seductive, confident signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Spicy<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Sensual<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Grapefruit, Cinnamon, Rose, Leather, Amber, Patchouli, Woods<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-66.jpg\",\"mid-00000-64.jpg\",\"box-00000-63.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-KZER',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 15:31:55','2025-05-01 12:31:08',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-66.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(72,'11 11 Myself','<p>A modern and vibrant fragrance that blends freshness with clean sensuality. It opens with bright Calabrian bergamot, leading into a heart of orange blossom, and settles on a warm and smooth base of ambrofix™ and soft woods for a minimalist yet expressive signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Floral<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Clean<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Calabrian Bergamot, Orange Blossom, Ambrofix™, Woody Notes<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-67.jpg\",\"mid-00000-65.jpg\",\"box-00000-64.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-DRSW',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 15:33:29','2025-05-01 12:30:53',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-67.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(73,'11 11 Nomad','<p>A rich and daring fragrance that evokes the spirit of exploration. It opens with warm saffron and spicy black pepper, layered over a heart of oud and cocoa, and finishes with deep leather and amber notes for a powerful and adventurous signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Spicy<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Saffron, Black Pepper, Oud, Cocoa, Leather, Amber<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-53.jpg\",\"mid-00000-51.jpg\",\"box-00000-50.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-ZMOA',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 15:46:04','2025-05-01 12:30:33',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-53.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(74,'11 11 Orchid','<p>A bold and luxurious fragrance with a dark, sensual edge. It opens with rich truffle and blackcurrant, blending into exotic black orchid and spices. The base of patchouli, incense, and vanilla creates a deep and unforgettable trail.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Floral<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Dark &amp; Sensual<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Truffle, Blackcurrant, Black Orchid, Spices, Patchouli, Incense, Vanilla<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-52.jpg\",\"mid-00000-50.jpg\",\"box-00000-49.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-C0QC',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-04-21 15:50:22','2025-05-01 12:30:16',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-52.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(75,'11 11 Prestige','<p>A bold and complex fragrance that blends smoky, resinous, and spicy notes with deep woods. It opens with oregano, bergamot, and pimento berry, evolves into amber, incense, and opoponax, and finishes with leather, oud, and patchouli for a dramatic and powerful presence.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Smoky &amp; Spicy<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Oregano, Bergamot, Pimento, Amber, Incense, Opoponax, Leather, Oud, Patchouli<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-51.jpg\",\"mid-00000-49.jpg\",\"box-00000-48.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-HWO4',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:04:41','2025-05-01 12:29:58',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-51.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(76,'11 11 Rouge','<p>An iconic and radiant fragrance that balances sweetness with airy woodiness. It opens with saffron and jasmine, leading to a glowing heart of amberwood and ambergris, and settles into a warm base of fir resin and cedarwood for a truly addictive signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Amber Floral<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Sweet &amp; Woody<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Saffron, Jasmine, Amberwood, Ambergris, Fir Resin, Cedarwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-50.jpg\",\"mid-00000-48.jpg\",\"box-00000-47.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-CUH5',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-04-21 16:06:45','2025-05-01 12:29:42',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-50.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(77,'11 11 Sauvage','<p>A bold and fresh fragrance that captures raw masculinity and freedom. It opens with spicy bergamot and pepper, followed by a heart of lavender and geranium, and finishes with earthy patchouli, vetiver, and ambroxan for a powerful, long-lasting signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Aromatic Fougere<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Spicy<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Bergamot, Pepper, Lavender, Geranium, Patchouli, Vetiver, Ambroxan<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-49.jpg\",\"mid-00000-47.jpg\",\"box-00000-46.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-BONI',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,18,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'2025-04-21 16:09:04','2025-05-01 12:29:19',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-49.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(78,'11 11 Silver','<p>A crisp and invigorating fragrance inspired by fresh mountain air and flowing streams. It opens with vibrant bergamot and mandarin, flows into a heart of green tea and blackcurrant, and settles on a clean base of musk and sandalwood for a refreshing and modern signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Citrus Aromatic<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Clean<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Bergamot, Mandarin, Green Tea, Blackcurrant, Musk, Sandalwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-48.jpg\",\"mid-00000-46.jpg\",\"box-00000-45.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-5QSC',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:10:48','2025-05-01 11:50:18',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-48.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(79,'11 11 Tobacco','<p>A warm and opulent fragrance that blends sweet tobacco with creamy vanilla and rich spices. It opens with spicy notes and tobacco leaf, leading into a heart of tonka bean and cacao, and finishes with dried fruits and woody undertones for a luxurious, enveloping scent.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Spicy<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Sweet<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Tobacco Leaf, Spices, Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Cacao, Dried Fruits, Woods<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-47.jpg\",\"mid-00000-45.jpg\",\"box-00000-44.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-QGWZ',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:12:53','2025-05-01 11:49:54',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-47.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(80,'11 11 Tygar','<p>A radiant and energetic fragrance that captures the contrast between fresh citrus and warm amber. It opens with a burst of grapefruit, revealing a sophisticated heart of ginger and ambroxan, and settles into a smooth, ambery base that is both powerful and refined.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Citrus Amber<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Warm<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Grapefruit, Ginger, Ambroxan, Woody Notes, Amber<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-46.jpg\",\"mid-00000-44.jpg\",\"box-00000-43.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-UT17',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:14:33','2025-05-01 11:49:34',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-46.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(81,'11 11 Uomo','<p>A seductive and modern fragrance that blends intensity with elegance. It opens with vibrant vanilla and fresh lavandin, moves into a heart of clary sage, and finishes with a warm base of vetiver and amber, creating a bold and charismatic signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Amber Fougere<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Aromatic<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Vanilla, Lavandin, Clary Sage, Vetiver, Amber<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-45.jpg\",\"mid-00000-43.jpg\",\"box-00000-42.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-3EKC',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:16:50','2025-05-01 11:49:20',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-45.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(82,'11 11 Y','<p>A fresh and modern fragrance that captures the spirit of creativity and confidence. It opens with crisp apple and bergamot, unfolds into a heart of sage and geranium, and finishes with warm amberwood and tonka bean for a clean, masculine signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Aromatic Fougere<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Woody<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Apple, Bergamot, Sage, Geranium, Amberwood, Tonka Bean<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p><h2> </h2>','','published','[\"side-00000-44.jpg\",\"mid-00000-42.jpg\",\"box-00000-41.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-L0P1',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:18:17','2025-05-01 11:48:57',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-44.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(83,'11 11 You','<p>A warm and addictive fragrance full of charm and energy. It opens with spicy cardamom and pink pepper, followed by a heart of sage and melon, and settles into a rich base of chestnut, vanilla, and amberwood for a truly modern and magnetic scent.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Fougere<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Spicy<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Cardamom, Pink Pepper, Sage, Melon, Chestnut, Vanilla, Amberwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-43.jpg\",\"box-00000-40.jpg\",\"mid-00000-41.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-P9KN',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:30:21','2025-05-01 11:48:30',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-43.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(84,'11 11 Adore','<p>A radiant and feminine fragrance that celebrates floral elegance. It opens with fresh notes of bergamot and pear, blooms into a heart of jasmine, rose, and ylang-ylang, and finishes with soft musk and cedarwood for a graceful, timeless signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Floral<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Elegant &amp; Bright<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Bergamot, Pear, Jasmine, Rose, Ylang-Ylang, Musk, Cedarwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-42.jpg\",\"mid-00000-40.jpg\",\"box-00000-39.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-LBGX',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL,0,'2025-04-21 16:39:30','2025-05-01 11:48:11',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-42.jpg','physical',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(85,'11 11 Belle','<p>A joyful and luminous fragrance that radiates elegance and happiness. It opens with juicy pear and blackcurrant, flows into a floral heart of iris, jasmine, and orange blossom, and finishes with sweet notes of vanilla, praline, tonka bean, and patchouli.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Floral Gourmand<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Sweet &amp; Elegant<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Pear, Blackcurrant, Iris, Jasmine, Orange Blossom, Vanilla, Praline, Tonka Bean, Patchouli<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-41.jpg\",\"mid-00000-39.jpg\",\"box-00000-38.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-MYJI',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU