strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-21.jpg\",\"mid-00000-19.jpg\",\"box-00000-19.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-KKAY',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 10:57:31','2025-05-01 11:38:38',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-21.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(108,'11 11 Silk Queen','<p>A luxurious and radiant fragrance that blends saffron and passion fruit with a heart of tuberose and rose, finishing with warm oud, vanilla, and ambroxan for a smooth, silky signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Floral Oriental<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Soft &amp; Luxurious<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Saffron, Passion Fruit, Tuberose, Rose, Oud, Vanilla, Ambroxan<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-20.jpg\",\"mid-00000-18.jpg\",\"box-00000-18.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-35J8',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 10:59:25','2025-05-01 11:38:16',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-20.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(109,'11 11 Valaya','<p>A fresh and luminous fragrance that opens with bergamot and white peach, flows into a floral heart of orange blossom and vetiver, and settles on a soft base of musk and ambroxan for a clean, radiant signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Floral Musky<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Elegant<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Bergamot, White Peach, Orange Blossom, Vetiver, Musk, Ambroxan<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-19.jpg\",\"mid-00000-17.jpg\",\"box-00000-17.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-XLLL',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 11:02:54','2025-05-01 11:35:04',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-19.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(110,'11 11 Vanilla','<p>A warm and irresistible fragrance that blends creamy vanilla and tonka bean with brown sugar and soft amber, creating a sweet, comforting signature that lingers beautifully on the skin.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Gourmand Oriental<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Sweet &amp; Warm<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Brown Sugar, Amber, Musk<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-18.jpg\",\"mid-00000-16.jpg\",\"box-00000-16.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-OA2Y',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 11:04:28','2025-05-01 11:34:45',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-18.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(111,'11 11 Alexa','<p>A luxurious and powerful fragrance that opens with vibrant lavender and cinnamon, unfolds into a heart of Bulgarian rose and cedarwood, and settles on a rich base of oud, amber, and musk for a majestic and long-lasting signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Rich &amp; Regal<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Lavender, Cinnamon, Rose, Cedarwood, Oud, Amber, Musk<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-17.jpg\",\"mid-00000-15.jpg\",\"box-00000-15.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-HKEM',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 11:13:09','2025-05-01 11:34:23',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-17.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(112,'11 11 Imperial','<p>A refined and luxurious fragrance that opens with crisp apple and saffron, flows into a heart of rose and suede, and settles on a rich base of amber, vanilla, and sandalwood for an elegant and long-lasting trail.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Floral<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Sophisticated<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Apple, Saffron, Rose, Suede, Amber, Vanilla, Sandalwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-16.jpg\",\"mid-00000-14.jpg\",\"box-00000-14.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-EM7C',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 11:17:01','2025-05-01 11:34:03',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-16.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(113,'11 11 Interlude Black','<p>A bold and mysterious fragrance that opens with spicy bergamot and rosemary, evolves into a heart of iris, frankincense, and myrrh, and settles on a smoky base of leather, oud, and amber for a deep, dramatic signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Smoky &amp; Sophisticated<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Bergamot, Rosemary, Iris, Frankincense, Myrrh, Leather, Oud, Amber<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-15.jpg\",\"mid-00000-13.jpg\",\"box-00000-13.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-YTFG',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 11:19:54','2025-05-01 11:33:46',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-15.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(114,'11 11 Malon','<p>A fresh and uplifting fragrance that opens with zesty lime and juicy mandarin, balanced by aromatic basil and a touch of amberwood for a crisp, elegant signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Citrus Aromatic<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Clean<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Lime, Mandarin, Basil, Amberwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-14.jpg\",\"mid-00000-12.jpg\",\"box-00000-12.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-KGNG',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 11:22:54','2025-05-01 11:33:30',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-14.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(115,'11 11 Maracuja','<p>An exotic and daring fragrance that contrasts juicy passion fruit with deep oud and spicy saffron. The bold blend is enriched by leather and akigalawood, creating a powerful and unforgettable signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fruity Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Exotic &amp; Bold<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Passion Fruit, Saffron, Oud, Leather, Akigalawood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-13.jpg\",\"mid-00000-11.jpg\",\"box-00000-11.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-WB30',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2025-04-22 11:26:13','2025-05-01 11:33:12',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-13.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(116,'11 11 Mega','<p>An intense and aquatic fragrance that evokes the endless depth of the ocean. It blends marine notes with ambergris, seaweed, and musk, creating a salty, mysterious, and long-lasting signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Aquatic Woody<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Marine &amp; Intense<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Marine Notes, Ambergris, Seaweed, Musk<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-12.jpg\",\"mid-00000-10.jpg\",\"box-00000-10.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-IU8Z',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,'2025-04-22 11:29:04','2025-05-01 11:32:50',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-12.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(117,'11 11 Oud Wood','<p>A smooth and refined fragrance that blends rare oud with creamy sandalwood and spicy cardamom. Warm amber and tonka bean round out the scent, creating a luxurious and timeless signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Oriental<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Sophisticated<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Oud, Sandalwood, Cardamom, Amber, Tonka Bean<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-11.jpg\",\"mid-00000-9.jpg\",\"box-00000-9.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-UXOX',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,'2025-04-22 11:34:23','2025-05-01 11:32:35',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-11.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(118,'11 11 Pura','<p>A vibrant and juicy fragrance that opens with a burst of citrus fruits and sweet Mediterranean accords. The heart is fruity and playful, while the base of white musk, amber, and vanilla adds softness and longevity.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Fruity Oriental<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Sweet<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Citrus Fruits, Mediterranean Fruits, Vanilla, White Musk, Amber<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-10.jpg\",\"mid-00000-8.jpg\",\"box-00000-8.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-RZWB',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,'2025-04-22 11:36:42','2025-05-01 11:32:16',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-10.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(119,'11 11 Santal','<p>A clean and distinctive fragrance that blends creamy sandalwood with cardamom, violet, and leather. Smoky and softly spicy, it leaves a bold yet comforting signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Aromatic<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Creamy &amp; Smoky<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Sandalwood, Cardamom, Violet, Leather, Cedarwood<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-9.jpg\",\"mid-00000-7.jpg\",\"box-00000-7.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-USEH',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2025-04-22 11:38:38','2025-05-01 11:30:48',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-9.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(120,'11 11 Stellar','<p>A radiant and opulent fragrance that blends orange blossom with creamy amber and soft white musk. Warm, smooth, and luminous, it leaves a celestial and captivating signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Floral<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Radiant<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Orange Blossom, Amber, Musk, White Flowers<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-8.jpg\",\"mid-00000-6.jpg\",\"box-00000-6.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-4TDF',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,9,'2025-04-22 11:40:20','2025-05-01 11:30:32',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-8.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(121,'11 11 Terroni','<p>A deep and fiery fragrance that captures the essence of earth and fire. It blends rich oud, smoky woods, and resins with a touch of red berries for a powerful, grounded signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Oriental<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Earthy &amp; Smoky<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Oud, Resins, Woods, Incense, Red Berries<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-7.jpg\",\"mid-00000-5.jpg\",\"box-00000-5.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-TEMI',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2025-04-22 11:41:46','2025-05-01 11:30:11',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-7.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(122,'11 11 Memo','<p>A wild and charismatic fragrance that blends warm spices with leather and aromatic herbs. Cardamom and saffron meet a heart of geranium and cumin, resting on a rich base of leather and vetiver.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Leather Spicy<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Warm &amp; Wild<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Cardamom, Saffron, Geranium, Cumin, Leather, Vetiver<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p><h2> </h2>','','published','[\"side-00000-6.jpg\",\"mid-00000-4.jpg\",\"box-00000-4.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-I1HP',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,7,'2025-04-22 11:44:59','2025-05-01 11:29:51',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-6.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(123,'11 11 Oud','<p>A majestic and powerful fragrance that blends rich oud with saffron, nutmeg, and lavender. The base of patchouli and musk adds depth and elegance to this bold signature scent.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Spicy<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Bold &amp; Regal<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Oud, Saffron, Nutmeg, Lavender, Patchouli, Musk<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-5.jpg\",\"mid-00000-3.jpg\",\"box-00000-3.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-DGOJ',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,10,'2025-04-22 11:49:14','2025-05-01 11:29:27',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-5.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(124,'11 11 Orage','<p>A refined and earthy fragrance that combines vetiver and patchouli with crisp iris and peppery notes. Anchored by a musky, woody base, it delivers a clean and confident signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Woody Earthy<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Grounded<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Vetiver, Patchouli, Iris, Pepper, Musk<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-4.jpg\",\"mid-00000-1.jpg\",\"box-00000-00000.jpg\"]',NULL,'SF-2443-JUO5',0,50,0,0,'on_backorder',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,'2025-04-22 11:59:00','2025-05-01 11:29:09',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-4.jpg','digital',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(129,'11 11 Male','<p>A bold and timeless fragrance that opens with fresh mint and lavender, followed by warm cinnamon and orange blossom, and finishes with vanilla and tonka bean for a seductive, masculine signature.<br><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Oriental Fougere<br><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Fresh &amp; Warm<br><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Mint, Lavender, Cinnamon, Orange Blossom, Vanilla, Tonka Bean<br><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)<br><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</p>','','published','[\"side-00000-70.jpg\",\"mid-00000-68.jpg\",\"box-00000-67.jpg\"]',NULL,'11PFM-YGHNJ3',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL,1,'2025-04-24 12:58:16','2025-05-01 11:28:45',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','side-00000-70.jpg','physical',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(131,'11 11 Nuit','<p><span>A captivating union of sensual amber and elegant rose. This fragrance balances the warmth of golden amber with a lush Turkish rose heart, accented by a sparkle of pink pepper and citrus for a seductive, enveloping allure.</span></p><p><span><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Warm &amp; Spicy</span>  <br><span><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Amber Floral</span>  <br><span><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong> Amber, Rose, Pink Pepper, Patchouli</span>  <br><span><strong>Type:</strong> Eau de Parfum (EDP)</span>  <br><span><strong>Size:</strong> 50ml</span></p>','','published','[\"nuit-1.jpg\",\"nuit.jpg\"]',NULL,'11PFM-DKNJZC',0,50,0,0,'in_stock',0,NULL,0,0,40000,35000,NULL,NULL,0,0,0,0,NULL,4,'2025-04-24 16:39:05','2025-05-01 11:28:20',3,'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User','nuit-1.jpg','physical',NULL,0,0,0,0,0,NULL),(132,'11 11 Riviera','<p><span>A bright and elegant fragrance that balances lush florals with fresh green sweetness. Velvety rose blooms entwine with juicy fig and leafy greens, creating a sunny, sophisticated scent evoking a Mediterranean garden in full bloom.</span>  <br> </p><p><span><strong>Fragrance Family:</strong> Floral</span>  <br><span><strong>Scent Type:</strong> Green Floral</span>  <br><span><strong>Key Ingredients:</stron